  "_comment_representation_request": "VOICE-AGENT-250: the typed 'show it as a table' route. A typed message is a request to redraw the result on screen when, once accents are folded and the words split, it holds one of these view phrases (the longest wins) and every other word is a filler below; a one-word message never is ('Timeline' is a film). Anything else ('Nolan films as a table') goes to the search as before. The keys are the views of show_results_as in app/main.py (phase 2 lot B added 'compare', the side-by-side cards; phase 2 lot C 'histogram', 'share' and 'flags', and 'histogram' left 'columns'; phase 3 lot A 'scatter'). JS only (app/static/app.js, text2SqlRequestedView).",
